     * is the backstop. A verdict before arming is counted, not stored. The
     * ring keeps the latest CONFIG_NROS_EXECUTOR_MAX_VIOLATIONS verdicts;
     * CONFIG_NROS_VIOLATION_DRAIN_REPORT logs each one at the end of its spin,
     * CONFIG_NROS_TRACE_CALLBACKS traces it (markers 21-24) and
